 on AI adoption rates. Industry patterns: 20% power users, 20% refusers, 60% using chat tools.\n   831→                    </div>\n   832→                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n   833→                        <span class=\"source blog\">Simon Willison</span>\n   834→                        <span>• 2026-04-13</span>\n   835→                    </div>\n   836→                    <div class=\"tags\">\n   837→                        <span class=\"tag\">google</span>\n   838→                        <span class=\"tag\">agentic-engineering</span>\n   839→                        <span class=\"tag\">engineering-culture</span>\n   840→                    </div>\n   841→                </div>\n   842→\n   843→                <div class=\"item\">\n   844→                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n   845→                        <span class=\"insight-type opinion\">Opinion</span>\n   846→                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Apr/13/bryan-cantrill-laziness/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"accent-link\">LLMs Lack Laziness</a>\n   847→                    </div>\n   848→                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n   849→                        Bryan Cantrill: LLMs don't optimize for future time through abstractions. They make systems larger, not better.\n   850→                    </div>\n   851→                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n   852→                        <span class=\"source blog\">Simon Willison</span>\n   853→                        <span>• 2026-04-13</span>\n   854→                    </div>\n   855→                    <div class=\"tags\">\n   856→                        <span class=\"tag\">ai</span>\n   857→                        <span class=\"tag\">llms</span>\n   858→                        <span class=\"tag\">software-engineering</span>\n   859→                    </div>\n   860→                </div>\n   861→\n   862→                <div class=\"item\">\n   863→                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n   864→                        <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span>\n   865→                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Apr/11/sqlite-3.53.0/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"accent-link\">SQLite 3.53.0</a>\n   866→                    </div>\n   867→                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n   868→                        ALTER TABLE constraints, new json_array_insert(), significant CLI improvements with Query Results Formatter.\n   869→                    </div>\n   870→                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n   871→                        <span class=\"source blog\">Simon Willison</span>\n   872→                        <span>• 2026-04-11</span>\n   873→                    </div>\n   874→                    <div class=\"tags\">\n   875→                        <span class=\"tag\">sql</span>\n   876→                        <span class=\"tag\">sqlite</span>\n   877→                        <span class=\"tag\">webassembly</span>\n   878→                    </div>\n   879→                </div>\n   880→\n   881→                <div class=\"item\">\n   882→                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n   883→                        <span class=\"insight-type opinion\">Opinion</span>\n   884→                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Apr/10/ai-capability-gap/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"accent-link\">AI Capability Gap</a>\n   885→                    </div>\n   886→                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n   887→                        Andrej Karpathy: Domains with explicit reward functions (coding, security) improve faster due to RL trainability and B2B value.\n   888→                    </div>\n   889→                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n   890→                        <span class=\"source twitter\">Twitter</span>\n   891→                        <span>• 2026-04-10</span>\n   892→                    </div>\n   893→                    <div class=\"tags\">\n   894→                        <span class=\"tag\">andrej-karpathy</span>\n   895→                        <span class=\"tag\">generative-ai</span>\n   896→                        <span class=\"tag\">ai-capability</span>\n   897→                    </div>\n   898→                </div>\n   899→            </section>\n   900→        </div>\n   901→    </main>\n   902→\n   903→    <footer>\n   904→        <div class=\"footer-content\">\n   905→            <a href=\"#\">Archive</a>\n   906→            <a href=\"#\">About</a>\n   907→            <a href=\"#\">RSS Feed</a>\n   908→            <a href=\"#\">GitHub</a>\n   909→            <span style=\"margin: 0 8px;\">|</span>\n   910→            <span>Generated by AgentDaily - Tracking Agentic Coding Innovation</span>\n   911→        </div>\n   912→    </footer>\n   913→</body>\n   914→</html>"
